{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To support a loved one", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's been tough lately.", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But Mom's worked so hard, I just hope it pays off.", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 92}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I was just thinking about how my mom's job search is going.", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Actually, I was just thinking about how my mom's job search is going. It's been tough lately.", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Actually, I was just thinking about how my mom's job search is going.", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I just want things to work out for her.", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, it’s tough. We’ve had to cut back again, and it’s just stressing me out. I just want things to work out for her.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Mom's job search is still slow, and it's tough seeing her stressed.", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s been frustrating. We keep cutting back on expenses, but it doesn’t feel like we’re getting anywhere.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "We set some goals for Mom's job search, and it feels like we have a clearer path now.", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_nee