{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "To be reassured", "depth": 3, "parent_id": "nd002", "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But Mom's worked so hard, I just hope it pays off.", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 92}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It's nice to hear that, but I can't help feeling a bit anxious about everything. I just want things to be okay for everyone.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's nice to hear that, but I just can't help feeling anxious.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 62}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I’m just worried it might not work out.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I’m just worried it might not work out. We’ve had to cut back on some expenses again.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 158}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It’s been hard, especially since we had to cut back again. I just hope things work out for Mom.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, it’s tough. We’ve had to cut back again, and it’s just stressing me out. I just want things to work out for her.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "it's tough seeing her stressed.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s been frustrating. We keep cutting back on expenses, but it doesn’t feel like we’re getting anywhere.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Yeah, it feels like no matter what we do, we're not making progress. It's hard on both of us.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 93}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Maybe we could track her progress a bit more too.", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "That might help. I think we could start by setting some small, achievable goals for Mom's job search and tracking her progress.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 127}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Fingers crossed they help.", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 135}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I just hope it all works out smoothly.", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I just hope we find something soon.", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 84}, {"session_id": "p000560-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Having this support means a lot.", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 66}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261009T213424Z", "last_updated_at": "20261009T215036Z", "first_seen_session": "p000560-mem_needstate-s1", "last_session": "p000560-mem_needstate-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
